  "notes": "Version researched: Terraria 1.4.5.8 (PC). Goal: bosses (single-target damage).\nClass setups: https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups (Endgame section; the guide is still being revised for 1.4.5, so 1.4.5 item pages were checked too).\nAccessory slots: 7, for a Master world with the Demon Heart.\nWings: Celestial Starboard. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Celestial_Starboard\nBoss buff potions are in the inventory, favorited, because quick-buff (B) only uses potions in the inventory. Exploration and utility potions are in the piggy bank. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Buffs\nConvenience: Void Bag https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Void_Bag, Money Trough https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Money_Trough, Shellphone https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Shellphone, Rod of Harmony https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Rod_of_Harmony, Wormhole Potion for multiplayer https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Wormhole_Potion.\nLoadout 2 is a defensive set and loadout 3 an exploring set with the same armor.\nBuff stations (placed furniture) are in the safe: place them and right-click for their buff.\nBest modifiers is on, so every weapon and accessory you own gets its best modifier: Legendary for melee and whips, Unreal for ranged, Mythical for magic, Fabled for summon staffs, Menacing for accessories. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Modifiers\nAll-rounder: loadout 1 is melee, loadout 2 ranged, loadout 3 magic (switch loadouts in the equipment screen). The hotbar has each build's main weapon. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups\nThe Defender's Forge has the other melee, ranged and magic weapons; the safe has each class's buff potions and stations; the Void Vault has a full summoner kit (armor, accessories, weapons, potions) to swap in by hand.\nMelee: Zenith, Solar Flare, Fire Gauntlet, Berserker's Glove, Warrior Emblem. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups\nRanged: S.D.M.G. with Crystal Bullets for bosses, Vortex, Ranger Emblem, Recon Scope, Chaos Cylinder (no quiver on a gun build). https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Chaos_Cylinder\nMagic: Last Prism, Nebula, Celestial Emblem, Sorcerer Emblem, Celestial Cuffs, Mana Cloak, Mystic Arts Sash. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Mystic_Arts_Sash\nSummoner (in the Void Vault): Terraprisma and Stardust Dragon Staff (Fabled), Possession and Constellation (Legendary), Twilight Grasp and Ouroboros Ring. https://terraria.wiki.gg/wiki/Guide:Class_setups"
